OL,3,GNEWSAApple crusher will stay where it
OL,4,Ais, minister confirms
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to move a granite apple crusher
OL,7,Ffeature in Jersey have been scrapped
OL,8,Ffollowing a "significant" public
OL,9,Fresponse, a minister has said.
OL,11,FThe structure was due to be relocated
OL,12,Ffrom King Street to Howard Davis Park
OL,13,Fin St Helier as part of a #2.5m project
OL,14,Fto resurface and revamp nearby Broad
OL,15,FStreet.
OL,17,FOn Friday, the Constable of St Helier
OL,18,Fcalled for the "beautiful, colourful,
OL,19,Fmuch-loved feature" to be retained in
OL,20,Fits current position, while hundreds of
OL,21,Fpeople also shared their views on the
OL,22,Fproposals on social media.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
