OL,3,GNEWSAApple crusher will stay where it
OL,4,Ais, minister confirms
OL,5,
OL,6,FMinister for Infrastructure Jonathan
OL,7,FRenouf confirmed the apple crusher
OL,8,Fwould remain where it was after a
OL,9,F"significant body of public opinion"
OL,10,Fand plans for the area would be
OL,11,Frevised.
